		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>はい　どうぞ！
お客さん　いい　買い物したね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-12T03:10:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
